# Zentro Web — environment
#
# Angular reads configuration from src/environments/, not from a .env file at runtime —
# the browser has no process.env. This file documents the values those environment files
# hold, and is the reference when setting up a deployment.
#
# Nothing here is secret. Anything shipped to a browser is public by definition:
# never put an API key, a client secret or a token in this app.

# ─── API ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The backend origin. Must appear in the API's CORS_ORIGINS allowlist, and must be
# an exact origin — a wildcard cannot be used with credentialed requests.
API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/v1

# ─── Build ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Shown in the UI and attached to error reports so a bug can be traced to a build.
APP_VERSION=0.0.0

# ─── Observability ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional. Blank disables error reporting. A Sentry DSN is public by design —
# it identifies the project, it does not grant access to it.
SENTRY_DSN=
